aused by things outside our reasonable control.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-5","heading":"5. Ownership","body":"Once you've paid in full, you own the finished work we create for you. We keep the right to use our general tools, methods and know-how, and we may show the work in our portfolio unless you ask us not to.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-7","heading":"6. Confidentiality","body":"We'll each keep the other's private business information private, and use it only for this work.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-8","heading":"7. Warranty and liability","body":"We'll fix defects in our work that you report within 30 days of delivery, at no charge. Apart from that, our total liability under this agreement is limited to the fees you paid us in the 3 months before the claim.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-9","heading":"8. Term and cancellation","body":"Monthly services continue month to month until either of us cancels with 30 days' written notice. Fees already paid aren't refunded.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-10","heading":"9. Governing law","body":"This agreement is governed by the laws of the State of {{workspace.state}}.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-11","heading":"10. Entire agreement","body":"This signed proposal is the whole agreement between us about this work and replaces earlier discussions.","show_when":null}],"id":"be93c6d2-0e7a-4b79-8221-f00ffab9415c"},{"type":"page_break","id":"e37f96ce-b4d5-43d2-848d-0e03a0fe6199"},{"type":"heading","text":"Signatures","level":1,"id":"33f632b0-e7a5-4b28-8596-546a12c13e2f"},{"type":"signature_block","role":"client","id":"a232d978-8f77-40c1-806e-3ca66c4603e9"},{"type":"signature_block","role":"company","id":"1dd74541-5efa-4d86-8982-0cc52ef049c3"}],"default_quote":[],"default_items":[]},{"name":"Social media management","description":"A monthly social media plan: content, posting, replies and reporting.","starter_key":"social-media-management","starter_order":6,"active":true,"signature_heading_defaulted":true,"h