y under this agreement is limited to the fees you paid us in the 3 months before the claim.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-9","heading":"8. Term and cancellation","body":"Monthly services continue month to month until either of us cancels with 30 days' written notice. Fees already paid aren't refunded.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-10","heading":"9. Governing law","body":"This agreement is governed by the laws of the State of {{workspace.state}}.","show_when":null},{"id":"terms-11","heading":"10. Entire agreement","body":"This signed proposal is the whole agreement between us about this work and replaces earlier discussions.","show_when":null}],"id":"543c033b-5d9a-4775-8968-84548e048957"},{"type":"page_break","id":"0f2c57c0-9233-44b2-8135-a8eb62694707"},{"type":"heading","text":"Signatures","level":1,"id":"6cd3aa63-3fd5-494b-8244-fbc793165537"},{"type":"signature_block","role":"client","id":"5bd75eb2-b0f3-441e-803c-2a552de20a60"},{"type":"signature_block","role":"company","id":"0a9a3fd5-60dd-4949-8849-495f897488b1"}],"default_quote":[],"default_items":[]}$social$::jsonb
